"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"implementation-of","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implementation of"}]},{"type":"code","value":"ReactiveController.hostConnected","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"hostdisconnected","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hostDisconnected()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"hostDisconnected(): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L67","children":[{"type":"text","value":"controllers/hotkey.ts:67"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Releases registrations when the host disconnects."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"implementation-of-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implementation of"}]},{"type":"code","value":"ReactiveController.hostDisconnected","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"hostupdated","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hostUpdated()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"hostUpdated(): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L54","children":[{"type":"text","value":"controllers/hotkey.ts:54"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Refreshes options after rendering, when scoped targets are available."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"implementation-of-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implementation of"}]},{"type":"code","value":"ReactiveController.hostUpdated","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"implements","text":"Implements","level":2},{"id":"constructors","text":"Constructors","level":2},{"id":"constructor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"host","text":"_host","level":5},{"id":"hotkey","text":"_hotkey","level":5},{"id":"callback","text":"callback","level":5},{"id":"options","text":"_options?","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"methods","text":"Methods","level":2},{"id":"hostconnected","text":"hostConnected()","level":3},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"hostdisconnected","text":"hostDisconnected()","level":3},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-2","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"hostupdated","text":"hostUpdated()","level":3},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-3","text":"Implementation of","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L26)\n\nA Lit ReactiveController that registers a keyboard hotkey when the host\nelement is connected and unregisters it when the host is disconnected.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass MyElement extends LitElement {\n  private hotkey = new HotkeyController(this, 'Mod+S', () => this.save())\n\n  constructor() {\n    super()\n    this.addController(this.hotkey)\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Implements\n\n- `ReactiveController`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew HotkeyController(\n   _host, \n   _hotkey, \n   callback, \n   _options?): HotkeyController;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:37](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L37)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### \\_host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit component that owns this controller. Add the controller with `addController()`.\n\n##### \\_hotkey\n\n`RegisterableHotkey`\n\nThe shortcut to register.\n\n##### callback\n\n`HotkeyCallback`\n\nCalled with the host as `this`.\n\n##### \\_options?\n\n`HotkeyOptions` \\| (() => `HotkeyOptions`)\n\nOptions or a getter. Property getters are read on connection and after host updates.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`HotkeyController`\n\n## Methods\n\n### hostConnected()\n\n```ts\nhostConnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:48](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L48)\n\nRegisters when connected and a target is available.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostConnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostDisconnected()\n\n```ts\nhostDisconnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:67](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L67)\n\nReleases registrations when the host disconnects.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostDisconnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostUpdated()\n\n```ts\nhostUpdated(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:54](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L54)\n\nRefreshes options after rendering, when scoped targets are available.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostUpdated\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: HotkeyController\ntitle: HotkeyController\n---\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L26)\n\nA Lit ReactiveController that registers a keyboard hotkey when the host\nelement is connected and unregisters it when the host is disconnected.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass MyElement extends LitElement {\n  private hotkey = new HotkeyController(this, 'Mod+S', () => this.save())\n\n  constructor() {\n    super()\n    this.addController(this.hotkey)\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Implements\n\n- `ReactiveController`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew HotkeyController(\n   _host, \n   _hotkey, \n   callback, \n   _options?): HotkeyController;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:37](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L37)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### \\_host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit component that owns this controller. Add the controller with `addController()`.\n\n##### \\_hotkey\n\n`RegisterableHotkey`\n\nThe shortcut to register.\n\n##### callback\n\n`HotkeyCallback`\n\nCalled with the host as `this`.\n\n##### \\_options?\n\n`HotkeyOptions` \\| (() => `HotkeyOptions`)\n\nOptions or a getter. Property getters are read on connection and after host updates.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`HotkeyController`\n\n## Methods\n\n### hostConnected()\n\n```ts\nhostConnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:48](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L48)\n\nRegisters when connected and a target is available.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostConnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostDisconnected()\n\n```ts\nhostDisconnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:67](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L67)\n\nReleases registrations when the host disconnects.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostDisconnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostUpdated()\n\n```ts\nhostUpdated(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey.ts:54](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey.ts#L54)\n\nRefreshes options after rendering, when scoped targets are available.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostUpdated\n```\n"}
